*|DSPF 1.5
*|DESIGN "calibre_top"
*|VENDOR "Siemens"
*|PROGRAM "Calibre xRC"
*|DIVIDER /
*|DELIMITER :
*|BUSBIT <>
.SUBCKT calibre_top A<0> Z VSS
*|GROUND_NET VSS
*|NET A<0> 0.1PF
*|P (A<0> I 0 0 0)
*|S (A<0>:1 1 0)
Rneg A<0> A<0>:1 -2 $lvl=7
Cbad A<0>:1 VSS not-a-number
Cgood VSS A<0> 0.1PF $lvl1=7 $lvl2=0
Lignored A<0> A<0>:1 1N
*|NET Z 0
*|P (Z O 0 2 0)
*|S (Z:1 3 0)
Rz Z Z:1 1
Rcross Z:1 A<0>:1 5
unknown_record here
.ENDS calibre_top
